                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2. Condition of Obligation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The condition of this obligation is that if the Principal complies with the requirements of ORS Chapter 701 and the rules of the Construction Contractors Board, and pays all valid claims, final judgments, arbitration awards and orders for which the Principal is liable and which are recoverable against this bond under Oregon law, then this obligation is void. Otherwise it remains in full force and effect."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "3. Limit of Liability"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The aggregate liability of the Surety under this bond shall not exceed the penal sum of "
            },
            {
              "type": "mergeField",
              "attrs": {
                "field": "penal_sum",
                "filter": {
                  "name": "currency",
                  "currency": "USD"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", regardless of the number of claims made or the number of years this bond remains in force. Any payment made reduces the penal sum by the amount paid."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4. Term and Cancellation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This bond takes effect on "
            },
            {
              "type": "mergeField",
              "attrs": {
                "field": "effective_date",
                "filter": {
                  "name": "date",
                  "format": "MMMM D, YYYY"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and continues until cancelled. The Surety may cancel this bond by giving written notice to the Obligee, effective not less than thirty (30) days after the Obligee receives the notice. Cancellation does not release the Surety from liability for acts or omissions of the Principal occurring before the cancellation takes effect."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "5. Execution"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Signed, sealed and dated on "
            },
            {
              "type": "mergeField",
              "attrs": {
                "field": "execution_date",
                "filter": {
                  "name": "date",
                  "format": "MMMM D, YYYY"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
